# patterns without **/ match only the repo root — nested copies need **/

# secrets and local databases never go into the image
**/.env
**/*.db

# VCS and editors
.git
**/.idea
**/.vscode
**/.claude

# Python
**/.venv
**/venv
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache

# Node: dependencies and the build are recreated inside the image
# (a Windows node_modules would overwrite the Linux one and break native binaries)
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo
